@startuml
title 工程开发闭环
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #4F5D75
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #F5F5F5
  BorderColor #2D3142
  FontColor #2D3142
}
start
:需求与验收标准;
:读取项目规则与 Issue;
:只读探索 / 复现问题;
:形成计划、边界与风险;
:小步修改;
:构建、测试、静态检查;
:审查 diff 与运行证据;
:提交、PR、回滚或发布;
stop
@enduml
